# MAMBA-Sign-256 (Optimized)

- Instance name: MAMBA-Sign-256
- Security level tag: 256
- Parameter profile mode: DILITHIUM_MODE=5
- Parameter note: N=256 profile in current repository settings
- Public key bytes: 2592
- Secret key bytes: 768
- Signature bytes: 4627

## Build and KAT

- Build:
  -         make clean
  - make
- Run KAT:
  - ./KAT_SIG
  - make kat
- Official KAT filename (top-level pipeline output):
  - Test_Vectors/KAT_SIG_MAMBA-Sign-256.txt

## Implementation characteristics

- Type: Optimized
- Compiler requirement: C compiler compatible with GCC/Clang
- Instruction set requirement: AVX2/AES/SSE2/SSSE3
- External dependencies: none beyond standard toolchain
